- `port`: The V5 port number from 1-21
- `size_id`: The object to read from a list roughly ordered by object size (0 is the largest item, 1 is the second largest, etc.)
- `signature`: The signature ID [1-7] for which an object will be returned.

### Errors

- `ENXIO`: The given value is not within the range of V5 ports (1-21).
- `ENODEV`: The port cannot be configured as a vision sensor
- `EINVAL`: sig_id is outside the range [1-8]
- `EDOM`: size_id is greater than the number of available objects.
- `EAGAIN`: Reading the vision sensor failed for an unknown reason.

### Returns

The vision_object_s_t object corresponding to the given signature and size_id, or PROS_ERR if an error occurred.

### Example

```cpp
